{
  "_comment": [
    "Unified RVC configuration file.",
    "",
    "Top-level keys:",
    "  - schema_version:  version of this unified config schema (currently 1)",
    "  - models:          per-architecture training/inference hyper-parameters,",
    "                      keyed by '<version>/<sample_rate>'. Each entry has the",
    "                      same shape as the old configs/v1/<sr>.json files.",
    "  - realtime:        default settings for the realtime voice-changer tab",
    "                      (tools/rvc_for_realtime.py). These are only used as",
    "                      initial values by the WebUI; runtime overrides come",
    "                      through function arguments.",
    "",
    "Consumers:",
    "  - configs/config.py:Config.load_config_json()  -> returns the `models`",
    "      dict flattened to the legacy key format ('v1/32k', 'v2/48k', ...)",
    "      so existing call sites (infer-web.py, core.py) keep working unchanged.",
    "  - configs/config.py:Config.load_realtime_config() -> returns the",
    "      `realtime` dict.",
    "",
    "Replaces the following now-removed files:",
    "    configs/v1/32k.json    configs/v1/40k.json    configs/v1/48k.json",
    "    configs/v2/32k.json    configs/v2/48k.json",
    "and the previous configs/config.json that held only realtime defaults."
  ],
